# The shipped ticket prompts in packages/tickets-engine/prompts/ (the
# pipeline step prompts at the top level, the crew chat prompts in crew/
# and the run disciplines in disciplines/, req-279) are byte-compared raw
# (default-prompts.spec.ts, crew-prompts.spec.ts, discipline-texts.spec.ts):
# LF, newline-terminated. GitHub's Windows runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which would check the LF blobs out as CRLF and fail
# CI while local worktrees (never re-checked out) stay green. eol=lf
# overrides autocrlf at checkout.
packages/tickets-engine/prompts/**/*.md text eol=lf
# The shipped default crew (req-256), the same rule: LF, newline-terminated.
packages/tickets-engine/personas/**/*.md text eol=lf

# Migration-tool fixtures are legacy ticket files compared byte for byte (E14-3): LF at checkout
packages/tickets-engine/src/migrate/fixtures/** text eol=lf
